{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：21:56 2026-11-14 HKT</p>\n<img alt=\"衛蘭個唱頭場暗黑女王造型登場   前老闆黎明送「薯片花籃」: Show前唔好食 Show後馬上食\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl_square/d634d1553abe85ed5a59ac43fcd38b4c/2026-11/cats_49.jpg\"/>\n<p>衛蘭的《JANICE VIDAL 衛蘭 OUT OF FRAME 世界巡迴演唱會－香港站》共舉行4場，今晚（11月14日）舉行頭場。7時許場外已企滿等候入場的歌迷。場外亦擺放了不少花籃，當中包括「前老闆」黎明，花籃上擺滿了薯片，更印上金句：「Good Show，Good Luck，Show前唔好食，Show後馬上食。」另外又有張學友、容祖兒、張敬軒、莫文蔚、古巨基、張柏芝、梁詠琪、陳慧琳、楊千嬅、丁子高、方力申、炎明熹、王祖藍、李亞男等人，最令人驚喜的是，成龍大哥亦有致送花籃。至於到場睇騷的藝人包括蔡思貝、王君馨、鍾舒漫、泳兒、黃建東、Winka@COLLAR、雲浩影、黃淑蔓、洪嘉豪、梁思浩等。</p>\n<h2>衛蘭演唱近30首金曲</h2>\n<p>衛蘭以一身喑黑女王造型出場，從來旋轉階梯升降台中現身，先以《Break-a-way》、《My Cookie Can》、《一格格》幾首歌曲揭開序幕。衛蘭共會演唱近30首金曲，其中包括《心亂如麻》、《離家出走》、《你知道我在等你們分手嗎》、《就算世界無童話》、《愛才》等。</p>\n<img alt=\" 衛蘭以一身喑黑女王造型出場。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/8dcbfa2c229caab9d39ea2dfae4def9d/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-14_at_20_51_08_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"從旋轉階梯升降台中現身。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/03aa43a7c4de371f75c13e25c658c259/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-14_at_20_51_08.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"以《Break-a-way》、《My Cookie Can》、《一格格》幾首歌曲揭開序幕。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/3db7bba7c1cec26c164d0d46e5856c3d/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-14_at_20_51_09_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"以《Break-a-way》、《My Cookie Can》、《一格格》幾首歌曲揭開序幕。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/9a2a396a3337f8f828dc2aed8bb95c20/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-14_at_20_51_09_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"衛蘭共會演唱近30首金曲\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/06103562d72a87fcd65c04c542103a32/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-14_at_20_51_09.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"衛蘭的《JANICE VIDAL 衛蘭 OUT OF FRAME 世界巡迴演唱會－香港站》共舉行4場。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/9ef44c4ba16a5b19ddbeab06d2ad1c8c/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-14_at_20_51_10.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"今晚（11月14日）舉行頭場。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/b8c67f560850221529553d7ee46c0bfa/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-14_at_20_51_11.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"全場歌迷亮起熒光棒。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/4a09019524209702dc80cd3d45c1d9cb/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-14_at_20_51_13_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"表情多多。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/616aace01c604d7b0847c4d838027262/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-14_at_20_51_13_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Janice大騷歌藝。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/0f2d97ba228566bd91d8d7354deb94a8/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-14_at_20_51_13.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"歌迷反應熱烈。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/ef73e704b26b5e6bdd27a881e6ba258a/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-14_at_20_51_14.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黎明花籃。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/a4d648f435a0b79a0865332162870ae7/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-14_at_20_50_24_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"容祖兒花籃。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/a56a26023b3f40b9bcf00e97b4b08337/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-14_at_20_50_24_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張學友花籃。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/610adc7a3a602def7d1208513571a09c/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-14_at_20_50_24.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"莫文蔚花籃。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/92850710aca395b005e908a7881b983f/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-14_at_20_50_25_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張敬軒花籃。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/1e6df161dcf3d002378ae937f671e0c5/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-14_at_20_50_25.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"古巨基花籃。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/b0b12cf2831153b96d9c71e426dc2588/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-14_at_20_50_26_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張柏芝花籃。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/6baa0ae88e3dd17b4fd56da879109ce5/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-14_at_20_50_26_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"成龍花籃。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/479f552ade7a5d28dfadb6fa8540accd/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-14_at_20_50_26.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"梁思浩花籃。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/228091b78d6edde46440c5e53fabc73c/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-14_at_20_50_56.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"梁詠琪花籃。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/b28076bb32a33f821d920860b24386c4/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-14_at_20_51_01.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"王祖藍、李亞男花籃。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/67bc76d4e9f233a6f6b34eef30f0d6e7/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-14_at_20_51_02_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"李昊花籃。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/f2df8ba1059400a3ead9b6edce2b7772/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-14_at_20_51_02.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"炎明熹花籃。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/346bae6c3716c5303224c219ce71fc73/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-14_at_20_51_03.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳慧琳花籃。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/68af22e22064d34a8c900e5e0d7f5bf0/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-14_at_20_51_04_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"方力申花籃。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/81d755182b5515c549060a328180c6c2/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-14_at_20_51_04.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"楊千嬅、丁子高\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/37ec4d92ade74e7a5dc5757a399aa898/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-14_at_20_51_05.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"蔡思貝、王君馨、鍾舒漫、泳兒、黃建東、Winka@COLLAR到場支持。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/bdb88160e982123253674400ed136b56/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-14_at_20_51_05_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"雲浩影、黃淑蔓。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/b264c474d29cf7b4a22d4a9f87ed7162/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-14_at_20_51_06.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"梁思浩。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/117534a44bd19e345c839fb52cce73cd/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-14_at_20_51_07_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"洪嘉豪。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/282633a6200cd1785887f3c37ca53f09/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-14_at_20_51_07.jpeg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T14:06:07.172967+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":473,"images":32,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"non